## 4. Recommended Administrator Action Checklist

Use this checklist during weekly or monthly tenant hygiene reviews:

- [ ] **Clean Up Dormant Policies**: Review the unassigned policies in Section 2 and remove deprecated configurations.
- [ ] **Verify Security Baseline Coverage**: Confirm all active Windows devices receive BitLocker and Antivirus baselines.
- [ ] **Validate Administrative Changes**: Correlate recent audit events with district change approval tickets.
- [ ] **Check Assignment Exclusions**: Ensure exclusion groups do not create security coverage gaps.
- [ ] **Review App Deployment Status**: Retire unused store applications or legacy installers.

